  <item>
    <title>Hall County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/hall-county-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-hall-county-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>180-day moratorium from Feb 2026 (4-0). Commissioners voted unanimously on Aug 27, 2026 to impose new moratoriums on data centers and detention centers; the Gainesville Times article read does not state the new end date.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Covington: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/covington-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-covington-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>180-day moratorium enacted unanimously Jan 20, extended in July to October (Oct 20 per Covington News). Council lifted it early on Aug 31, 2026 after updating its data center ordinances.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Floyd County: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/floyd-county-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-floyd-county-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>80-day moratorium on data center permits, unanimously approved. On Aug 25, 2026 the commission approved a data center ordinance allowing data centers only in Heavy Industrial zones, replacing the pause.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Griffin: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/griffin-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-griffin-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Board of Commissioners unanimously approved a 180-day moratorium on &#x27;technological facilities&#x27; including data centers and cryptocurrency mining. UDC amendments adopted May 26, 2026 allow data centers only by special use permit in Planned Industrial districts and bar hyperscale campuses.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Newton County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/newton-county-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-newton-county-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Moratorium on data center development applications, first approved April 2025. Commissioners extended it unanimously on Oct 6, 2026, through Dec. 16.</description>
  </item>
